@anon.bcaf8a6642ef434db28a340da408f3d7.1716 = private unnamed_addr constant [1816 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for non-literal strings being passed to [`markupsafe.Markup`][markupsafe-markup].\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0A[`markupsafe.Markup`] does not perform any escaping, so passing dynamic\0Acontent, like f-strings, variables or interpolated strings will potentially\0Alead to XSS vulnerabilities.\0A\0AInstead you should interpolate the `Markup` object.\0A\0AUsing [`lint.flake8-bandit.extend-markup-names`] additional objects can be\0Atreated like `Markup`.\0A\0AThis rule was originally inspired by [flake8-markupsafe] but doesn't carve\0Aout any exceptions for i18n related calls by default.\0A\0AYou can use [`lint.flake8-bandit.allowed-markup-calls`] to specify exceptions.\0A\0A## Example\0AGiven:\0A```python\0Afrom markupsafe import Markup\0A\0Acontent = \22<script>alert('Hello, world!')</script>\22\0Ahtml = Markup(f\22<b>{content}</b>\22)  # XSS\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom markupsafe import Markup\0A\0Acontent = \22<script>alert('Hello, world!')</script>\22\0Ahtml = Markup(\22<b>{}</b>\22).format(content)  # Safe\0A```\0A\0AGiven:\0A```python\0Afrom markupsafe import Markup\0A\0Alines = [\0A    Markup(\22<b>heading</b>\22),\0A    \22<script>alert('XSS attempt')</script>\22,\0A]\0Ahtml = Markup(\22<br>\22.join(lines))  # XSS\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom markupsafe import Markup\0A\0Alines = [\0A    Markup(\22<b>heading</b>\22),\0A    \22<script>alert('XSS attempt')</script>\22,\0A]\0Ahtml = Markup(\22<br>\22).join(lines)  # Safe\0A```\0A## Options\0A- `lint.flake8-bandit.extend-markup-names`\0A- `lint.flake8-bandit.allowed-markup-calls`\0A\0A## References\0A- [MarkupSafe on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/MarkupSafe/)\0A- [`markupsafe.Markup` API documentation](https://markupsafe.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/escaping/#markupsafe.Markup)\0A\0A[markupsafe-markup]: https://markupsafe.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/escaping/#markupsafe.Markup\0A[flake8-markupsafe]: https://github.com/vmagamedov/flake8-markupsafe\0A", align 1
